WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:00.920
Hello, everybody!!

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:03.600
My name is Markiplier and welcome to Bear Simulator!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.100
[Beep]

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.060
Oh my goodness.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.160
Am I standing on my hind legs?

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.100
Oh, this is incredible.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:08.760
[soft ding of great achievement]

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:09.660
OH!

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:10.840
HURRAY!

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.080
I got an achievement!

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.180
I am bear!

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:13.760
[Beep]

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.300
Ah, the noble bear stalks his prey,

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.120
the common pond duck.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.900
Let me get down and crawl towards 'em!

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.060
He'll never see me coming!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:24.760
AHHHH!

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:25.740
I had you!

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.900
Don't swaf away!

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.240
Aww...

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.760
I lost my one chance to make a water fowl friend. :(

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:32.260
[Bing]

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.480
ARE YOU A BUNBUN?

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.560
BUNBUN GONNA DIEDIE!

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.080
HAHA!

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:36.740
[dying squeal]

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.380
'Defeated the demoralizing tan rabbit'.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.680
What, did he insult me as he went along?

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:42.180
[Boop]

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:44.640
Am I gonna be implicated for bear murder?

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:49.040
I swear, I didn't know Leo was just trying to film a movie in my woods!

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:50.560
I was just trying to help!

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.060
[Doot]

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:52.080
What is this?

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:55.140
'No Trespassing! Top Secret Military Research Compound'

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.300
Oh, hello. Hi!

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.500
Oh, it's a wolf boy!

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.320
He's rabid!

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.440
He looks like a corgi!

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.400
[Offended growling] Oh god.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.020
AHH!

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:01.980
OH! RUN AWAY!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.660
GERONIMOOO!

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.260
Uh oh.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.300
I shouldn't have done that...

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.280
[death sounds]

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.260
[First video]
This is nothing like Goat Simulator,

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.560
This is actually me as a bear!

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.280
[Second video]
[quietly] And I received another ball.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.600
[quietly] an odd medical condition,

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:17.000
[still quiet] to have an extra ball.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.180
[Third video]
I... I didn't chose this life!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.280
It was chosen for me!

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.140
'I wasn't born a fruit, like you.'

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.160
[laughter, fading out]

